}, "name": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "模型强度"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [308.16717529296875, 132.0537872314453], "pos": [3160.340576171875, 744.6679077148438], "id": 19, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.4.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["### Qwen2511-细节一致性修复工作流\n\n\n\n需要参考多个细节时可以把图片拼成一张或两张填入，但是需要保证细节清晰。\n\n支持填入三视图、多角色拼图、武器拼图、场景拼图、特效拼图、物件细节等。\n\n\n使用教程/本地部署: [哔哩哔哩-AIGC大饼](https://space.bilibili.com/297733457?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0)\n\n进学习交流群加作者微信: [哩布哩布首页](https://www.liblib.art/userpage/81b19c718c721cfc4e281fe4e11c5887/publish)\n\n放大工作流: [SeedVR2+TTP](https://www.liblib.art/modelinfo/fdb35fb388cd471184d3b8841da890c4?from=personal_page&versionUuid=161db319194c4eebad1c9f23dc29e81a)\n\n 作者平时做漫剧都是用的香蕉的九宫格工作流程，优点是速度快且可选择性多，缺点是这种方式出的图基本上细节的涂抹感都太重了，而且结构损坏严重，所以训练了这样一个模型来修正细节 ，达到可以直接去跑视频的程度，节省个人修图的时间 ，希望对大家有所帮助 ！\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Model Links", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [215.09466552734375, 308.1814270019531], "pos": [3346.54443359375, 255.94102478027344], "id": 47, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [31], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [], "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["8d37b9990ca6075a65453c7ff36688a61b660a27c136517c0a18c3d4bb120de1.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [279.81744384765625, 337.4811096191406], "pos": [2272.822509765625, 660.5415649414062], "id": 26, "properties": {"